  "description": "This Pallet Fok Frame can be used in daily work like loading haystacks, forking, and unloading for industrial work on farms.\nFitment\nFits almost all skid steers, loaders, and tractors such as the New Holland, Bobcat Skid Steer, and Kubota tractors.\nFeatures\nMultifunctional and Strong Frame‌: This versatile frame attaches to a hay spear for transporting straw bales or connects to a receiver for towing heavy-duty items, enhancing utility in diverse applications.\nStrong Bearing Capacity‌: Featuring a robust design, the YITAMOTOR pallet fork supports up to 5000 lb loads, serving as essential equipment for demanding agricultural and industrial tasks.\nCompatibility‌: Engineered to integrate fit for skid steer tractors, it efficiently handles operations across farms, factories, warehouses, and construction sites.\nAll-around Protection‌: Built from CNC-cut structural steel with a powder-coated finish, the heavy-duty frame ensures durability through precision welding for optimal fit and longevity.\nDimensions‌: Measuring 48 inches in length with 4-inch footprints on both sides, the durable pallet fork frame weighs 145 pounds for reliable performance.",
